Outlook for Linux: drop the Teams-only tray entry, rename the other.

"Join Meeting" opens a Teams meeting-join dialog that has no equivalent in
Outlook, so drop it. "Return to Teams" already just reloads whatever URL this
build was pointed at (Outlook, via the url rename in default.nix); only its
label said otherwise.

--- a/app/menus/appMenu.js
+++ b/app/menus/appMenu.js
@@ -9,15 +9,10 @@
       accelerator: "ctrl+O",
       click: () => Menus.open(),
     },
-    {
-      label: "Join Meeting",
-      accelerator: "ctrl+J",
-      click: () => Menus.joinMeeting(),
-    },
     {
-      label: "Return to Teams",
+      label: "Return to Outlook",
       click: () => Menus.returnToTeams(),
     },
     ...(Menus.configGroup.startupConfig.quickChat?.enabled
       ? [
           {
